sequenceDiagram
    participant MainLoop as loop()
    participant AI as app_input
    participant RP as render_pipeline
    participant MTX as stateMutex
    participant UI as ui panels (7)
    participant Panel as MIPI-DSI panel

    MainLoop->>AI: handleTouch()
    AI->>AI: sampleTouch(), dispatch tap
    AI-->>MainLoop: wantFix / wantSat / wantLog, pressChanged

    alt frame fully handled by app_input
        Note over AI: dark-screen tap consumed,<br/>or modal dimmer drew + pushed<br/>its own overlay already
        AI-->>MainLoop: return false
        Note over MainLoop: skip runRenderCycle() this frame
    else normal frame
        MainLoop->>RP: runRenderCycle(wantFix/Sat/Log, pressChanged)
        Note over RP: poll gate: 200ms, or a touch<br/>changed UI state, or press<br/>highlight moved
        RP->>MTX: captureSnapshot() (on poll only)
        MTX-->>RP: RenderSnapshot (by value)
        RP->>RP: hash each panel's own inputs
        loop for each of status/fix/sat/log
            alt signature changed, or want*, or full repaint
                RP->>UI: draw*Panel(snapshot)
                RP->>RP: markDirty(panelRect)
            end
        end
        RP->>Panel: pushDirty() -- banded, 120px slices
        loop each band
            RP->>Panel: pushSprite(clipped)
            RP->>AI: sampleTouch() between bands
            Note over RP,Panel: a full push blocks for a few ms<br/>with nothing polling touch --<br/>banding bounds that window
        end
    end
